WEBVTT

00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:03.280
Before stretching a brand, check five things.

00:00:03.330 --> 00:00:04.400
Positioning fit,

00:00:04.450 --> 00:00:05.521
distance from the core,

00:00:05.571 --> 00:00:06.712
consumer permission,

00:00:06.762 --> 00:00:08.162
risk versus reward,

00:00:08.212 --> 00:00:10.114
then test and monitor.

00:00:10.800 --> 00:00:12.590
Heinz soup is a near step.

00:00:12.640 --> 00:00:14.995
Pasta sauce, a credible stretch.

00:00:15.045 --> 00:00:15.974
Vodka?

00:00:16.024 --> 00:00:17.318
Shoppers squint.

00:00:17.368 --> 00:00:20.462
It only worked thanks to the vodka pasta moment.

00:00:21.167 --> 00:00:22.980
Allen's tested its stretch cheaply,

00:00:23.030 --> 00:00:27.541
with Pepsi and Mountain Dew collaborations instead of building new products alone.

00:00:28.233 --> 00:00:34.287
So walk every extension through all five checks, then launch, collaborate or avoid.
